{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"elixir","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Elixir","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Elixir (.ex .exs .heex .eex).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"elixir","name":"Elixir","extensions":[".ex",".exs",".heex",".eex"],"grammar":"grammars/elixir.json","lineComment":"#"}],"snippets":[{"language":"Elixir","path":"snippets/elixir.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/elixir.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"'''\",\n      \"end\": \"'''\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \":[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*[?!]?\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"@[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\|>|->|<-|=>|\\\\+\\\\+|<>\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:defoverridable|defexception|defdelegate|defprotocol|defmodule|defstruct|defguard|defmacro|defimpl|receive|require|reraise|unquote|import|rescue|return|unless|after|alias|catch|quote|raise|super|throw|cond|defp|else|when|with|and|def|end|for|not|try|use|do|fn|if|in|or)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|nil)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:Supervisor|GenServer|Integer|Keyword|Process|String|Stream|Float|Tuple|Agent|Atom|List|Enum|Task|Map)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:Enum\\\\.filter|Enum\\\\.reduce|IO\\\\.inspect|Enum\\\\.map|IO\\\\.puts|inspect|Map\\\\.get|length|put_in|get_in|elem|hd|tl)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/elixir.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Module\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"defm\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"defmodule ${1:Name} do\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"end\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A module\"\n  },\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"def\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"def ${1:name}(${2:args}) do\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"end\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A public function\"\n  },\n  \"Private function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"defp\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"defp ${1:name}(${2:args}) do\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"end\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A private function\"\n  },\n  \"Case\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"case\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"case ${1:value} do\",\n      \"\\t${2:pattern} -> $0\",\n      \"end\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"case\"\n  },\n  \"With\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"with\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"with {:ok, ${1:a}} <- ${2:fun()} do\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"end\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"with\"\n  },\n  \"GenServer\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"gen\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"use GenServer\",\n      \"\",\n      \"def init(${1:state}) do\",\n      \"\\t{:ok, ${1:state}}\",\n      \"end\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A GenServer\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Elixir\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Elixir.\n\n## Files\n\n`.ex`, `.exs`, `.heex`, `.eex`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `#`.\n- 6 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `defm` | A module |\n| `def` | A public function |\n| `defp` | A private function |\n| `case` | case |\n| `with` | with |\n| `gen` | A GenServer |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}